  "notes": "### Improved\n\n- **A modern window on Windows.** The app fills the whole window, as on a Mac: no grey title bar, with the minimise, maximise and close buttons in its own colours at the top right. Drag the window by its top edge or the sidebar; double-click there to maximise.\n\n### Fixed\n\n- A UPS's state and its power path no longer overlap the readings below them when the window is small or the page is long (most noticeable on Windows).\n- In a narrower window the sentence under the state wraps, and the power path stays beside it, centred, instead of dropping below it.\n- On a phone-sized window the power path is centred with even space around it, and its labels are no longer oversized.",
